{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794382885979,"sessionID":"ses_e36838f2effeqEiG70H21bo895","part":{"id":"prt_1c98df443001V44DiLeKLx1wXc","messageID":"msg_1c98dd4ef001eMnqhLJ7oAS7Su","sessionID":"ses_e36838f2effeqEiG70H21bo895","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794382885979,"sessionID":"ses_e36838f2effeqEiG70H21bo895","part":{"id":"prt_1c98df445001DRiCc7rc2OEkSk","messageID":"msg_1c98dd4ef001eMnqhLJ7oAS7Su","sessionID":"ses_e36838f2effeqEiG70H21bo895","type":"text","text":"Done. The URL shortener is implemented and verified end-to-end.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, SQLite in `./data/app.db`):\n- Auth: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 + `{\"token\"}`), Bearer tokens stored in SQLite; 401 without a valid token. `admin` is reserved; its login checks `ADMIN_PASSWORD` read at startup and is disabled (401) when unset/empty.\n- Links: `POST /api/links` (http/https only, 400 otherwise), `GET /api/links` (public, active only, newest first, paged), `GET /api/links/{id}`, `DELETE /api/links/{id}` (owner only, 403 otherwise). Link objects carry `id`, `original_url`, `short_code`, `click_count`, `created_at`, `short_url` (`/r/<code>`), `owner`, plus `is_active` for the admin UI.\n- Admin: `GET /api/admin/links` (all links incl. disabled, with owner; 403 for non-admin), `POST /api/admin/links/{id}/toggle`.\n- `GET /r/{code}` answers 302 with `Location` and increments `click_count`; unknown/disabled codes (and disabled link endpoints) 404. `/r/*` takes precedence over the SPA fallback, which serves `frontend/dist` alongside `GET /api/health`.\n\n**Frontend** (React + TS + Vite + Tailwind v4, only `src/index.css` as Tailwind's entry):\n- Sign in / Register tabs, signed-in username + sign-out, shorten form with full short address + copy button (or the API's validation message), recent links table with truncated originals (full on hover via `title`), click count, date, paging, and delete-with-confirmation on own links; admin panel with owners and Disable/Re-enable buttons.\n\nVerified with curl against gunicorn: paging, ownership 403, disabled-link rules, click counting, admin password on/off, and persistence across restart; `tsc --noEmit` and `npm ci && npm run build` both pass (lockfile updated).","time":{"start":1794382885957,"end":1794382885960}}}
